    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "As the Light was ripped from his being, Gabriel's screams were silenced in the hiss of gospel in praise of God. ▼A boiling anguish to which even the fires of Hell could not compare. ▼Through the blaze of torment a single burning hatred was forged anew. ▼\n}\nIf the machines seek blood, he would give it freely; ▼\nand with such fury, even metal will bleed. ▼"
